	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Le camere del b&b]]></title>
		<link>https://www.beb-algiardino.com/le-camere-del-bed-and-breakfast-a-lecce-salento/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 05 Jul 2019 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
